---
// "Draft for review" mark on each story stage (FR-003, FR-037). Real text, so
// assistive technology reads it; the border keeps it visible in forced colours.
---

<span
  data-draft-mark
  class="inline-block rounded border border-rust-800 bg-rust-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-rust-950 dark:border-rust-300 dark:bg-dusk-900 dark:text-rust-100"
  >Draft for review</span
>
